        <item>
            <title>0.8.8</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 04:39:47 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.8.8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.8.8</h2>
<ul>
<li>Keyboard navigation matches the ring: arrow keys walk the pills in true clockwise order (they used to follow the original layout after rearranging)</li>
<li>Arrow keys now work in menus reached through the Compass (they went silent after a Compass switch)</li>
<li>Compass: pressing an arrow key instantly opens the menu in that direction — the Compass is the four arrows</li>
<li>Mode flip works both ways: an empty mode no longer traps the keyboard (down-arrow appeared dead)</li>
<li>Closing a menu without firing sounds the same everywhere — one soft close sound in every menu</li>
<li>The auto-recenter sound now follows the movement: longer flights sound longer and louder, it starts when the cursor visibly moves, tiny corrections stay silent — and long Compass glides got their full length back (they ran fast and quiet on a mis-measured distance)</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
