        <item>
            <title>0.8.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 22:16:51 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.8.7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.8.7</h2>
<ul>
<li>Arrange mode now edits deliberately: clicking a pill no longer opens its editor — right-click it, then click the pencil badge</li>
<li>Entering edit mode plays the menu-open sound</li>
<li>Pills look identical everywhere: the outer (⌥) ring in Arrange renders each pill exactly as the live menu does, labels included</li>
<li>Edit mode no longer prints keyboard shortcuts on pills — that information lives in the tooltip only</li>
<li>Arrange rearrangement got the list treatment: empty slots trade places live in both directions, and every drop settles from under your cursor with no flicker</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
