        <item>
            <title>0.8.6</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 08:04:48 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.8.6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.8.6</h2>
<ul>
<li>Cancel now has its own voice: the red ✗, backing out of a confirmation, and closing the menu from the hub all play a soft water-drop sound, clearly distinct from firing a pill</li>
<li>Every gesture plays exactly one sound — several doubled-up cues (folder close, ⌥ flip, cancel-then-close) were removed</li>
<li>⌥ layer flips and folder open/close now share the navigation tick</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
